{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"Leaf nods, \"Me too!\"","created_at":"2020-07-23T23:56:06.312000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736008774875086969","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"Web nods. \"I need you both to understand that what I am going to tell you in the next few minutes is done it utmost confidence. Should you repeat a word of what I say here to anyone without my express permission, I will consider you dead to me and dispose of your body as such. Do you understand?\"","created_at":"2020-07-23T23:56:56.358000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736008984783224995","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"Web is deadly serious. They aren't messing around","created_at":"2020-07-23T23:57:10.166000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736009042698436608","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"The colors are somewhat different however\"","created_at":"2020-07-23T23:57:14.550000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736009061086134392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"Fabertell soberly nods \"Understood\"","created_at":"2020-07-23T23:57:45.177000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736009189545213963","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"Web turns to leaf, waiting for her response","created_at":"2020-07-23T23:58:02.877000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736009263784132638","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"Leaf nods quickly, \"It's all between me and the Wild Mother of course, and she's very good at keeping secrets!\"","created_at":"2020-07-23T23:59:24.089000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736009604412211310","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"Web chuckles and begins to lead, sloshing through the dirty water below.","created_at":"2020-07-23T23:59:45.687000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736009695000526938","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"(this is gonna be a lil exposition heavy btw)","created_at":"2020-07-23T23:59:56.043000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736009738436870184","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"Most kinds of druidic circles believe in the sanctity of life. Many believe in honoring the dead properly. Our kind of circle, a circle of spores, does not hold life and death in the same ways that many others do. \"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:01:21.667000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736010097570086994","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"To most, the undead are an abomination, a blight on the living. They are seen as a mockery of the wholeness and goodness of nature. Our circle sees these sorts of things differently. Obviously undeath is somewhat unusual in a circle of life, but it has its uses.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:03:03.153000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736010523233091664","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"Raising the dead, so long as they do not stay that way forever and do not try to put an end to the living, cannot be so bad. If we are willing to use the bodies of the dead as fertilizer, why not use them to actually tend to our garden?\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:04:25.811000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736010869925740676","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"What if the undead could be used to protect us from truly unnatural things such as wanton technological advancement with no respect for nature? If life is precious, should unlife not be as well?\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:05:55.347000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736011245467074601","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"Fabertell nods \"Does it also use other parts of the dead aside from merely their body?\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:06:04.919000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736011285614952548","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"Web grins in the darkness. \"Ah yes, the question of the soul. I'll be getting to that, don't you worry.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:06:47.133000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736011462673170522","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"Fabertell grins \"I am more concerned with dreams than with souls but perhaps there is overlap.\" They listen intently","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:07:22.833000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736011612409823273","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"At this point Web pauses and leads you on in silence for a bit. You reach a split in the chamber and Web leads you down a ladder and continues talking. \"The circle of spores is a bit of a black sheep for other reasons as well. Most druidic circles tend to deal with the brighter and more commonly accepted aspects of nature. We value the scavengers. When a noble beast falls, we believe the best way to honor its life is not to immortalize it with magic, but to use it as fuel for life anew. This is not so unusual in and of itself, but we would also consider raising again that guardian of the wood to continue to guard for many years more.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:11:09.415000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736012562763743324","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"Now then, in regards to the soul. Victor Frankenstein's concern about only using the bodies of atheists is, quite frankly, laughable. The body of a devout believer is of no more use to that god than that of a nonbeliever. To put it simply, our circle holds that simple reanimation claims no part of the personhood of a deceased individual.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:14:03.499000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736013292924829759","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"So is what i see in Victor's creation only a reflection of the past inhabitant?","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:15:05.629000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736013553517068290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"That I cannot say.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:15:26.057000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736013639198441614","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"Or is Victor's work different?\" Leaf says, thinking over what she's heard","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:15:50.192000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736013740427968622","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"It did not feel different but I am not certain it would if it were\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:16:03.203000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736013794999795732","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"I am nowhere near familiar enough with his creations to understand that much about them. What I personally think is that he has, in some way, managed to hold some part of the person that once was in his golems.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:16:30.197000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736013908220837949","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"It did not feel different from a living person is my meaning.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:16:44.004000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736013966131593357","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"Web nods at this. \"Whether or not it is the original matters no great deal to me. If it is aware enough to feel pain, it should not be treated unfairly.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:17:26.340000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736014143701778484","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"Leaf nods, \"I think there's a difference between using a person's mind and a person's body. It sounds like what your circle does only moves the body, not the soul, right?\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:17:59.902000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736014284470878308","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"Yes, that is how we see it.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:18:15.994000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736014351965618209","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"I am in agreement with the both of you.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:19:23.688000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736014635894833154","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"The reason that zombies and the like that we raise are beholden to their master's will is not because their will is bent. It is because their will is gone. What remains of someone's habits and their mind is only the imprint of muscular habits. Different zombies will walk different ways, move in different ways. This is not because there is still someone inside of their, but simply because their muscles are used to moving in a certain manner.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:19:30.001000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736014662373474424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"And that is my concern with victor. I do not think they make a distinction, nor do I think they care. So I wish to establish which part is in use.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:19:59.009000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736014784042106920","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"After our discussion with Victor earlier today I feel inclined to trust him that his creations are happy. I do not believe that he holds any sway over the spirits of those whose bodies he uses, though I cannot say for certain.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:21:05.138000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736015061406974044","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"His beliefs about 'the red thread of fate' indicate to me that his creations are happy because he is able to satisfy their base instinct for companionship. After all, the soul can leave more than mechanical imprints on the body. There is a reason my circle does not seek to raise dead who can have complex thought, anything more than urges.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:22:50.989000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736015505378508810","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"Well we should determine if we were in the wrong so we can apologize if so and return the creature and if not...\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:22:52.557000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736015511955046470","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"There is enough of the creatures mind left for me to know its life as a tax accessor\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:23:26.321000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736015653571395594","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"It still dreams.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:23:48.865000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736015748127785051","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"(been called away, brb)","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:24:14.877000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736015857230282902","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"Whether this is a reflection or the body is merely offering me a portal into that viewing I can not say, I do not know. It is enough to give me concern.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:24:33.095000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736015933641982025","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"Hmm, yes, those memories are interesting to me. Those dreams provoke further complications about his work, but I myself would not feel qualified enough to make a decision as of yet. \"","created_at":"2020-07-24T00:24:58.153000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736016038742720583","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
